From: Prithwiraj Samanta <app@datainsights.ae>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 08:14:56 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 5/7] telecode: add a telecode StorageAdapter backed by the
 TeleDesign REST API

A TeleDesign project's canvas is one .fig at
GET/PUT /api/design/projects/{id}/canvas. Register it as the 'telecode'
storage provider and add openTelecodeProject(), which opens the project
bound to that provider so Save and autosave write it back (an unsaved
project opens empty with the same binding). Writes skip the local-first
IndexedDB mirror: the proxy versions and restores doc.fig itself, and a
mirror would shadow a restore made on the server.
